OL,3,GNEWSAFamous Morecambe and Wise script
OL,4,Ato be auctioned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rehearsal script of one of the most
OL,7,Ffamous sketches in British comedy
OL,8,Fhistory is to go to auction after it
OL,9,Fwas found in a suitcase.
OL,11,FThe Grieg Concerto sketch is a classic
OL,12,Fcomedy routine from The Morecambe and
OL,13,FWise Show, broadcast as part of a 1971
OL,14,FChristmas special on the BBC.
OL,16,FThe comedy piece, which starred
OL,17,Finternationally renowned conductor
OL,18,FAndre Previn - referred to throughout
OL,19,Fby Eric Morecambe as Andrew Preview -
OL,20,Fwill form part of a comedy sale at
OL,21,FHansons Auctioneers in Etwall on 27
OL,22,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
