OL,3,GNEWSAFamous Morecambe and Wise script
OL,4,Ato be auctioned
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe nine-page typewritten document,
OL,7,Fwhich includes numerous amendments by
OL,8,FErnie Wise in blue Biro, has the
OL,9,Fimmortal line: "I am playing all the
OL,10,Fright notes, but not necessarily in the
OL,11,Fright order."
